ot",299.04,299.34],["quite",299.34,299.68],["a",299.68,299.82],["low",299.82,300.0],["mark.",300.0,300.5]]},{"start":300.86,"end":305.96,"text":"But it made me realise that I'd been wasting too much time doing endless research,","words":[["But",300.86,301.24],["it",301.24,301.38],["made",301.38,301.62],["me",301.62,301.82],["realise",301.82,302.2],["that",302.2,302.52],["I'd",302.52,302.8],["been",302.8,302.94],["wasting",302.94,303.32],["too",303.32,303.78],["much",303.78,304.08],["time",304.08,304.42],["doing",304.42,304.68],["endless",304.68,305.28],["research,",305.28,305.96]]},{"start":306.26,"end":309.66,"text":"which meant putting the actual writing off until the last minute.","words":[["which",306.26,306.56],["meant",306.56,306.76],["putting",306.76,307.02],["the",307.02,307.26],["actual",307.26,307.68],["writing",307.68,308.22],["off",308.22,308.58],["until",308.58,308.9],["the",308.9,309.12],["last",309.12,309.36],["minute.",309.36,309.66]]},{"start":310.4,"end":314.86,"text":"It's a good example of how I recognised a weakness in the way I work.","words":[["It's",310.4,310.9],["a",310.9,311.0],["good",311.0,311.12],["example",311.12,311.56],["of",311.56,311.82],["how",311.82,312.04],["I",312.04,312.36],["recognised",312.36,312.86],["a",312.86,313.28],["weakness",313.28,313.6],["in",313.6,314.02],["the",314.02,314.14],["way",314.14,314.34],["I",314.34,314.52],["work.",314.52,314.86]]},{"start":315.54,"end":319.02,"text":"I avoid that now by giving myself a deadline for reading.","words":[["I",315.54,315.9],["avoid",315.9,316.12],["that",316.12,316.44],["now",316.44,316.76],["by",316.76,316.98],["giving",316.98,317.26],["myself",317.26,317.74],["a",317.74,318.0],["deadline",318.0,318.34],["for",318.34,318.7],["reading.",318.7,319.02]]},{"start":319.22,"end":319.64,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",319.22,319.64]]},{"start":320.36,"end":326.62,"text":"Oh wow! Look at this. You've got a really high mark in that test. That must have been","words":[["Oh",320.36,320.92],["wow!",320.92,321.26],["Look",321.6,322.08],["at",322.08,322.22],["this.",322.22,322.42],["You've",322.82,323.18],["got",323.18,323.28],["a",323.28,323.36],["really",323.36,323.74],["high",323.74,324.08],["mark",324.08,324.38],["in",324.38,324.58],["that",324.58,324.8],["test.",324.8,325.22],["That",325.84,326.12],["must",326.12,326.3],["have",326.3,326.48],["been",326.48,326.62]]},{"start":326.62,"end":332.66,"text":"good for your ego. Yes, it was a real achievement. Getting such a good result made me finally","words":[["good",326.62,326.82],["for",326.82,327.0],["your",327.0,327.14],["ego.",327.14,327.44],["Yes,",327.68,328.06],["it",328.18,328.34],["was",328.34,328.48],["a",328.48,328.64],["real",328.64,328.9],["achievement.",328.9,329.6],["Getting",330.16,330.36],["such",330.36,330.68],["a",330.68,330.9],["good",330.9,331.14],["result",331.14,331.64],["made",331.64,332.02],["me",332.02,332.22],["finally",332.22,332.66]]},{"start":332.66,"end":337.06,"text":"realise I could do really well. I always doubted that before.","words":[["realise",332.66,333.14],["I",333.14,333.74],["could",333.74,333.94],["do",333.94,334.2],["really",334.2,334.56],["well.",334.56,334.96],["I",335.54,335.82],["always",335.82,336.06],["doubted",336.06,336.54],["that",336.54,336.7],["before.",336.7,337.06]]},{"start":337.58,"end":343.24,"text":"Why did you include these class notes? Because it was the first time I felt like I didn't","words":[["Why",337.58,338.1],["did",338.1,338.24],["you",338.24,338.34],["include",338.34,338.7],["these",338.7,338.98],["class",338.98,339.3],["notes?",339.3,339.72],["Because",340.3,340.78],["it",340.78,341.0],["was",341.0,341.18],["the",341.18,341.34],["first",341.34,341.66],["time",341.66,342.06],["I",342.06,342.26],["felt",342.26,342.48],["like",342.48,342.7],["I",342.7,342.86],["didn't",342.86,343.24]]},{"start":343.24,"end":348.52,"text":"need a handout or another student's notes. I could rely on my own notes.","words":[["need",343.24,343.48],["a",343.48,343.58],["handout",343.58,344.1],["or",344.1,344.64],["another",344.64,345.0],["student's",345.0,345.7],["notes.",345.7,346.06],["I",346.6,347.0],["could",347.0,347.22],["rely",347.22,347.48],["on",347.48,347.74],["my",347.74,347.9],["own",347.9,348.1],["notes.",348.1,348.52]]},{"start":348.52,"end":352.28,"text":"Ah, so you took responsibility for your own learning.","words":[["Ah,",348.52,348.86],["so",349.08,349.34],["you",349.34,349.62],["took",349.62,350.06],["responsibility",350.06,350.92],["for",350.92,351.48],["your",351.48,351.64],["own",351.64,351.88],["learning.",351.88,352.28]]},{"start":352.4,"end":354.78,"text":"Yes, that's exactly why I put it in.","words":[["Yes,",352.4,352.86],["that's",352.96,353.26],["exactly",353.26,353.82],["why",353.82,354.16],["I",354.16,354.3],["put",354.3,354.42],["it",354.42,354.58],["in.",354.58,354.78]]},{"start":355.22,"end":357.4,"text":"These presentation notes are interesting.","words":[["These",355.22,355.66],["presentation",355.66,356.22],["notes",356.22,356.76],["are",356.76,356.94],["interesting.",356.94,357.4]]},{"start":357.9,"end":360.14,"text":"I like the way you've designed the mind map.","words":[["I",357.9,358.1],["like",358.1,358.28],["the",358.28,358.44],["way",358.44,358.56],["you've",358.56,358.78],["designed",358.78,359.16],["the",359.16,359.38],["mind",359.38,359.74],["map.",359.74,360.14]]},{"start":360.88,"end":362.44,"text":"Did that make it easier for you to remember?","words":[["Did",360.88,361.0],["that",361.0,361.18],["make",361.18,361.36],["it",361.36,361.5],["easier",361.5,361.78],["for",361.78,361.96],["you",361.96,362.02],["to",362.02,362.12],["remember?",362.12,362.44]]},{"start":363.04,"end":367.16,"text":"Well, I hardly had to refer to the notes at all during the presentation","words":[["Well,",363.04,363.54],["I",363.82,364.02],["hardly",364.02,364.38],["had",364.38,364.62],["to",364.62,364.78],["refer",364.78,365.04],["to",365.04,365.3],["the",365.3,365.42],["notes",365.42,365.74],["at",365.74,365.88],["all",365.88,366.1],["during",366.1,366.34],["the",366.34,366.52],["presentation",366.52,367.16]]},{"start":367.16,"end":369.68,"text":"because I could visualize the mind map.","words":[["because",367.16,367.56],["I",367.56,368.02],["could",368.02,368.24],["visualize",368.24,368.78],["the",368.78,369.08],["mind",369.08,369.36],["map.",369.36,369.68]]},{"start":370.04,"end":374.28,"text":"So this is in the portfolio as an example of knowing what works for you?","words":[["So",370.04,370.36],["this",370.36,370.68],["is",370.68,370.82],["in",370.82,370.94],["the",370.94,371.04],["portfolio",371.04,371.56],["as",371.56,372.0],["an",372.0,372.12],["example",372.12,372.48],["of",372.48,372.78],["knowing",372.78,373.06],["what",373.06,373.38],["works",373.38,373.84],["for",373.84,374.08],["you?",374.08,374.28]]},{"start":374.42,"end":375.06,"text":"That's right.","words":[["That's",374.42,374.82],["right.",374.82,375.06]]},{"start":375.54,"end":377.28,"text":"Wow, that's really useful.","words":[["Wow,",375.54,375.88],["that's",376.06,376.3],["really",376.3,376.66],["useful.",376.66,377.28]]},{"start":377.28,"end":378.82,"text":"Thanks so much, Laura.","words":[["Thanks",377.28,377.96],["so",377.96,378.3],["much,",378.3,378.56],["Laura.",378.6,378.82]]},{"start":382.34,"end":384.24,"text":"That is the end of Part 3.","words":[["That",382.34,382.8],["is",382.8,383.0],["the",383.0,383.18],["end",383.18,383.44],["of",383.44,383.58],["Part",383.58,383.82],["3.",383.82,384.24]]},{"start":384.98,"end":389.58,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["You",384.98,385.54],["now",385.54,385.76],["have",385.76,386.02],["30",386.02,386.46],["seconds",386.46,386.96],["to",386.96,387.54],["check",387.54,387.9],["your",387.9,388.26],["answers",388.26,388.68],["to",388.68,388.96],["Part",388.96,389.18],["3.",389.18,389.58]]}]}